  "releaseNotes": "# AID v1.0.2\n\n## 中文发布说明\n\n### 修复内容\n\n- 修复统一源码仓在网络抖动或标签检出不完整时误报 `frontend/admin/package.json` 缺失的问题。\n- 源码构建器现在会在编译前分别核验远端版本标签、实际提交、Git 文件树以及本地工作区中的关键文件，并明确区分“远端版本缺少文件”和“本地检出不完整”。\n- Gitee 首次检出异常时会清理不完整目录，随后按精确的 `refs/tags/\u003c版本\u003e` 引用在 Gitee 同源重试；只有连续校验失败后才会切换 GitHub 备用源。\n- 发布流程新增统一仓源码契约闸门，在代码推送前和更新清单激活前校验服务端根构建文件、后台管理端与 Web 用户端的 `package.json`/lock 文件以及源码构建器。\n\n### 兼容性与升级说明\n\n- 本版本不包含数据库结构或初始化数据变更，不需要执行额外 SQL。\n- 源码检出失败发生在编译、数据库迁移和版本切换之前，不会替换当前运行版本；网络恢复后可以安全重试。\n- 升级前仍建议备份数据库、部署配置、证书和用户媒体目录，并在业务低峰执行源码构建。\n\n# AID v1.0.2\n\n## English Release Notes\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fixed a misleading `frontend/admin/package.json` missing error when a unified-source checkout was incomplete because of a transient network or tag checkout issue.\n- The source builder now verifies the remote release tag, resolved commit, Git tree, and required worktree files before compilation, and reports remote source omissions separately from incomplete local checkouts.\n- When the first Gitee checkout fails verification, the incomplete directory is removed and the exact `refs/tags/\u003cversion\u003e` reference is retried from Gitee. GitHub is used only after both verified Gitee attempts fail.\n- Added public monorepo contract gates before source publication and before manifest activation. The backend build files, both frontend package manifests and lockfiles, and the source builder must all exist in the release tag.\n\n### Compatibility and Upgrade Notes\n\n- This release contains no database schema or initialization-data changes and requires no additional SQL migration.\n- A source checkout failure occurs before compilation, database migration, and version switching, so the currently running version is not replaced and the operation can be retried safely after connectivity is restored.\n- Back up the database, deployment configuration, certificates, and user media before upgrading, and run source builds during a low-traffic maintenance window.",
